# A short tour as a GIF: servers, a rules dialog, skills, preview, doctor.
Output "docs/screenshots/tour.gif"
Source "docs/tapes/config.tape"
Set Framerate 12
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.0

Hide
Type "skilltri" Enter
Sleep 3s
Show
Sleep 1.5s
Down@600ms 4
Sleep 1.5s
Up@600ms 3
Sleep 600ms
Type "r"
Sleep 2.5s
Escape
Sleep 600ms
Type "2"
Sleep 1.5s
Down@500ms 6
Sleep 1.5s
Type "3"
Sleep 1.5s
Down@500ms 3
Sleep 2s
Type "5"
Sleep 3s
